{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16444","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第五拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第五拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水头宿兮草头坐，风吹汉地衣裳破。\n羊脂沐发长不梳，羔子皮裘领仍左。\n狐襟貉袖腥复膻，昼披行兮夜披卧。\n毡帐时移无定居，日月长兮不可过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}